## Flags for the VM of the daemon binary: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## UTF-8 file names and terminal output even when the service manager or a
## container sets no locale (launchd agents, `docker run`).
+fnu
-kernel standard_io_encoding unicode

## Ctrl-C ends the command (`daemon logs -f`, `login`, a foreground daemon)
## instead of opening the emulator's break menu. Service managers stop the
## daemon with SIGTERM, which stays a graceful shutdown.
+Bd
